  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maharashtra Rural Connectivity Improvement Project - Additional Financing</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maharashtra Rural Connectivity Improvement Project (Additional Financing) is programmed as a 2022 firm project for $150 million in ADB&apos;s country operations business plan 2020-2022 for India. The Government of India requested to advance the loan to 2020 and increase the amount to $300 million during the tripartite portfolio review meeting and the ensuing reconnaissance mission in October 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
